  "description": "To Chart a Well-Trod Course is a 4 episode limited series podcast, following the AI LAVINI's first solo journey across the solar system. Guided by the jaded and defensive Dr. Winstead, LAVINI is hoping for a quiet and mostly solitary journey across the stars. But Dr. Winstead is desperate to prove himself capable after a tragedy he created, and LAVINI refuses to let the same mistakes happen again. Featuring trust, betrayal, and how to move forward when forgiveness isn't an option. To Chart a Well-Trod Course episode 1 releases 5th October 2021.",
